flowchart TD
    A[Registration Confirmed] --> B[Seminar Date Approaches]
    B --> C[Pre-Event Notifications]
    C --> D[Seminar Day Arrives]
    
    D --> E[User Arrives at Venue]
    E --> F{User Present?}
    
    F -->|No| G[Admin Marks Absent]
    F -->|Yes| H[Admin Marks Present]
    
    G --> I[Status: Not Attended]
    H --> J[Status: Attended]
    
    J --> K[Seminar Completion]
    I --> K
    
    K --> L[Post-Event Processing]
    L --> M[Update Participation Records]
    L --> N[Generate Attendance Reports]
    
    M --> O[Certificate Generation]
    N --> P[Analytics Update]
    
    O --> Q[Final Status: Completed]
    P --> Q
